{"id":"03d6215f-0604-442f-9396-7ceb6723e41d","revision":0,"last_node_id":637,"last_link_id":949,"nodes":[{"id":245,"type":"CreateVideo","pos":[2600,-850],"size":[270,110],"flags":{},"order":31,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":948},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":873},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":872},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[667]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"},"widgets_values":[30,8]},{"id":291,"type":"79280513-53b2-4417-93f8-f3e116bb6736","pos":[3650,-930],"size":[290,160],"flags":{},"order":33,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"Before Video","localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":846},{"label":"After Video","localized_name":"video_1","name":"video_1","type":"VIDEO","link":880},{"name":"direction","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"direction"},"link":null},{"name":"match_image_size","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"match_image_size"},"link":null},{"name":"spacing_width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"spacing_width"},"link":null},{"name":"spacing_color","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"spacing_color"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[738]}],"title":"6. 드라이빙 영상과 비교","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.13.0","previewExposures":[]},"widgets_values":["right",true,0,"white"]},{"id":292,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[4050,-930],"size":[760,106],"flags":{},"order":34,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":738},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null}],"title":"7. 비교 영상 저장","properties":{},"widgets_values":["video/ComfyUI","auto","auto"]},{"id":246,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[2940,-930],"size":[620,106],"flags":{},"order":32,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":667},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":[846]}],"title":"5. 생성 영상 저장","properties":{},"widgets_values":["video/ComfyUI","auto","auto"]},{"id":574,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1150,1050],"size":[650,1680],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"시연 가이드 — Wan Animate 2","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# Wan Animate 2 시연 순서\n\n**입력:** 캐릭터 이미지 1장 + 동작이 담긴 드라이빙 영상\n\n1. **캐릭터 기준 이미지**를 넣습니다. 전신 영상이면 전신 이미지처럼 구도를 맞추는 것이 가장 중요합니다.\n2. **드라이빙 영상**을 넣습니다. 별도의 DWPose/키포인트 추출은 필요 없습니다.\n3. 첫 번째 **Motion Transfer**에서 외형·배경 프롬프트와 동작 프롬프트를 수정합니다.\n4. 드라이빙 영상의 전체 프레임 수를 자동으로 읽어 필요한 샘플러 구간을 계산하고, 오른쪽에서 결과 및 원본 비교 영상을 저장합니다.\n\n## RTX 3090 권장값\n\n- 모델: INT8 ConvRot\n- 해상도: **482 × 854**부터 테스트\n- 길이: **81프레임**\n- Cache device: **cpu** (VRAM 급증 방지)\n- Cache dtype: **int8**\n- 첫 테스트는 다른 대형 모델을 언로드한 뒤 실행\n\n## 프롬프트 구분\n\n- **prompt:** 캐릭터 외형과 배경만 설명\n- **pose_prompt:** 춤, 표정, 팔 동작처럼 영상 속 동작 설명\n- 외형 프롬프트에 동작을 섞지 않으면 제어가 더 명확합니다.\n\n## 품질 팁\n\n- 기준 이미지와 영상의 인물 크기·카메라 구도를 비슷하게 맞추세요.\n- 손이나 소품이 프레임 밖으로 자주 나가면 결과가 흔들릴 수 있습니다.\n- 긴 영상은 frames_per_sampler만 GPU에 맞게 정하면 자동으로 구간을 나눠 연결합니다.\n\n## GPU VRAM별 시작 설정\n\n### 24GB — RTX 3090 / 4090\n\n- 이 워크플로 기본값인 **482 × 854 / 81프레임**부터 시작\n- Cache device: **cpu**, Cache dtype: **int8** 권장\n- 다른 대형 모델을 먼저 언로드하고 실행\n\n### 16GB — RTX 4080 / 5080급\n\n- 먼저 **480p급 / 49프레임**으로 테스트\n- Cache device: **cpu**, Cache dtype: **int8** 필수 권장\n- frames_per_sampler를 **49**로 설정해 자동 분할\n- 시스템 RAM은 32GB 이상 권장하며, 부족하면 디스크 스왑 때문에 매우 느려질 수 있음\n\n### 12GB — RTX 3060 / 4070급\n\n- **384–448p급 / 33프레임**부터 시작\n- Cache device: **cpu**, Cache dtype: **int8** 사용\n- 브라우저·게임·다른 생성 프로그램처럼 VRAM을 쓰는 앱을 먼저 종료\n- frames_per_sampler를 **33**으로 설정해 짧은 구간으로 자동 처리\n- 14B INT8 본체가 VRAM보다 크므로 CPU 오프로딩이 많아져 속도가 크게 느릴 수 있음\n- 시스템 RAM 32GB 이상과 충분한 페이지 파일 권장\n\n## 메모리 부족 시 낮추는 순서\n\n1. 프레임 수: **81 → 49 → 33**\n2. 해상도: 긴 변과 짧은 변을 함께 낮추기\n3. Cache device가 **cpu**인지 확인\n4. 다른 모델 언로드 및 ComfyUI VRAM 정리\n5. frames_per_sampler를 81 → 49 → 33으로 낮추기\n\n> 12GB·16GB 설정은 시스템 RAM, 다른 GPU 프로그램, 드라이버와 선택한 길이에 따라 달라집니다. 첫 실행은 짧고 낮은 해상도로 성공 여부를 확인한 뒤 단계적으로 올리세요."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":575,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2100,1050],"size":[900,1500],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"모델 설치 — 클릭 다운로드","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# 모델 설치 — 파일명을 누르면 바로 다운로드\n\n이 시연본은 **ComfyUI v0.31.1 / RTX 3090 24GB** 기준입니다.\n\n> 링크를 누르면 브라우저 다운로드가 시작됩니다. 다운로드가 끝나면 아래 표시된 ComfyUI 모델 폴더에 넣고 모델 목록을 새로고침하세요.\n\n## 1. Diffusion Model — 필수\n\n[⬇ wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors (약 16.65GB)](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- 저장 위치: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n- 12GB·16GB·24GB 사용자 공통 권장 INT8 본체\n\n## 2. 4-Step 속도 LoRA — 필수\n\n[⬇ lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors (약 738MB)](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/loras/lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- 저장 위치: `ComfyUI/models/loras/`\n\n## 3. UMT5 Text Encoder — 필수\n\n[⬇ umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors (약 6.74GB)](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- 저장 위치: `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## 4. CLIP Vision — 필수\n\n[⬇ clip_vision_h.safetensors (약 1.26GB)](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- 저장 위치: `ComfyUI/models/clip_vision/`\n\n## 5. Wan VAE — 필수\n\n[⬇ Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors (약 254MB)](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/vae/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n- 저장 위치: `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n- 기존 `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`가 정상 인식되면 그것을 선택해도 됨\n\n## 전체 모델 페이지\n\n[Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2 공식 저장소 열기](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/tree/main)\n\n## 이 워크플로의 연결 흐름\n\n`기준 이미지 + 드라이빙 영상 → Motion Transfer → 프레임 결합 → 영상 저장 → 원본/결과 비교`\n\n## 주의\n\n- 기존 `wan22AnimateFP...` 파일은 구형 Animate 모델이며 Animate 2 본체를 대신할 수 없습니다.\n- 두 번째 Motion Transfer는 기본 **bypass** 상태입니다. 81프레임보다 길게 만들 때만 활성화하세요.\n- 대용량 파일은 다운로드 완료 전에 ComfyUI 폴더로 옮기거나 이름을 바꾸지 마세요."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":540,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1700,-270],"size":[760,250],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"자동 확장 — 연결 구조","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 자동 확장 노드 연결\n\n외부에서 완성한 MODEL · CONDITIONING · SAMPLER · SIGMAS를 입력합니다.\n\nSageAttention, LoRA, Context Window, Animate2 Cache 같은 패치는 **Long Sampler 앞쪽 MODEL 라인**에 적용하세요. 노드 내부에서는 구간별 WanAnimate2ToVideo → Sampler → Trim → VAE Decode를 자동 반복합니다.\n\n**Cache 권장:** CPU / INT8. GPU 캐시는 81프레임에서 VRAM 피크가 커질 수 있습니다."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":607,"type":"CreateVideo","pos":[-1640,120],"size":[270,102],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":875},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":877},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":876},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[880,922]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"},"widgets_values":[30,8]},{"id":539,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1700,40],"size":[760,210],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"자동 확장 — 프레임 설정","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 자동 확장 설정\n\n- total_frames: 드라이빙 영상의 전체 프레임 수가 자동 입력됩니다.\n- frames_per_sampler: GPU가 한 번에 처리할 구간 길이입니다.\n- 24GB: **81** / 16GB: **49** / 12GB: **33**부터 시작하세요.\n- 각 구간은 1프레임을 이어받고, 마지막 결과는 total_frames에 정확히 맞춰 잘립니다."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":608,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[-1112.8394094218893,-940.9251277305871],"size":[660,130],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[884]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","models":[{"name":"wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan-Animate-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors","directory":"diffusion_models"}]},"widgets_values":["wan_animate_2_int8_convrot.safetensors","default"]},{"id":611,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-376.6039465743675,-618.0857183086976],"size":[490,120],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":885},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[937]}],"title":"CLIP Text Encode (Negative Prompt)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["low quality, blurry, overexposed, underexposed, frozen motion, static pose, jitter, flicker, motion discontinuity, cropped body, close-up, human face, exposed face, missing helmet, child, childlike proportions, T-shirt, shorts, bare feet, indoor apartment, white door, household spray can, copied driving-video room, identity drift, red armor, missing gold trim, missing antennae, asymmetrical helmet, armor changes, deformed hands, extra fingers, extra arms, extra legs, duplicate body, warped anatomy, text, subtitles, watermark, logo"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":612,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-376.6039465743675,-948.0857183086976],"size":[480,310],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":886},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[936]}],"title":"CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["A single adult blue, white and gold insect-themed armored hero is shown full-body inside a sleek futuristic circular transformation chamber. Preserve the exact reference design: glossy cobalt-blue helmet, large glowing cyan compound eyes, two long gold antenna horns, silver mechanical jaw, blue segmented armor with gold trim, white chest and abdomen panels, blue gloves and boots, and the detailed gold transformation belt. A small unstable cyan energy capsule glows on the floor in front of him. The hero performs an expressive defensive reaction matching the driving video: beginning in a low crouch, touching one side of the helmet, leaning sharply backward and sideways, extending one arm in a dramatic guard, stepping around the capsule, then bending down as the capsule tips and rolls away. Maintain the same adult heroic proportions, helmet, armor, belt and circular sci-fi chamber throughout. Smooth readable tokusatsu movement, stable full-body framing, cool blue energy arcs, polished metal reflections, cinematic lighting."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":615,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-376.6039465743675,-418.085718308699],"size":[490,220],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":887},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[942]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["Transfer only the body motion and timing from the driving video to the adult armored hero. Full-body sequence: begin in a relaxed low stance beside a small floor object, lift one hand behind the head, recoil and lean the torso backward, extend one arm outward in a dramatic blocking gesture, shift weight sideways with bent knees, then bend down toward the object as it tips and rolls. Keep the target hero's adult proportions, armor and futuristic chamber; reinterpret the floor object as a glowing cyan energy capsule. Ignore the driving performer's identity, age, clothing, room and background."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":616,"type":"ContextWindowsManual","pos":[180.5566440037432,-955.2463088868085],"size":[300,410],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":888},{"localized_name":"context_length","name":"context_length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"context_length"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"context_overlap","name":"context_overlap","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"context_overlap"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"context_schedule","name":"context_schedule","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"context_schedule"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"context_stride","name":"context_stride","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"context_stride"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"closed_loop","name":"closed_loop","type":"BOOLEAN","widget